WEBVTT

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:31.663
U redu. Izvrsno.

00:05:31.663 --> 00:05:34.579
Mogli bi začepiti taj flomaster
i staviti mi ga na stol.

00:05:35.246 --> 00:05:37.413
Ok, sad uzmite drugi flomaster iz čaše

00:05:38.704 --> 00:05:40.121
i odčepite ga

00:05:40.663 --> 00:05:42.704
i obojite mi magarca, obojite magarca.

00:05:42.913 --> 00:05:43.996
Široko črčkanje.

00:05:46.121 --> 00:05:48.204
Dobro, sad začepite taj flomaster

00:05:48.329 --> 00:05:49.621
i stavite ga na stol.

00:05:49.829 --> 00:05:52.663
Odaberite drugi flomaster i odčepite.

00:05:52.788 --> 00:05:53.954
Nije li zabavno?

00:05:54.288 --> 00:05:56.538
I obojite mi sovu, obojite sovu.

00:05:58.913 --> 00:06:00.954
Ok, sad začepite taj flomaster